The Volkswagen up! 'White Edition' was a special edition trim level available throughout the up!'s production run. It was typically based on a mid-range trim like 'High up!' and featured specific white styling elements, unique wheels, and enhanced interior trim. It was commonly offered with the 1.0L 60 PS or 75 PS petrol engine in earlier years, and the 65 PS engine in later years. I will evaluate based on the 1.0L 65 PS engine, as it was available in the 'White Edition' in the most recent production years (e.g., 2021).

